	<element name="Sorcerer" type="Class" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_WOTC_PHB_CLASS_SORCERER">
		<description><p>Sorcerers carry a magical birthright conferred upon them by an exotic bloodline, some otherworldly influence or exposure to unknown cosmic forces.</p><p>Hit Dice: 1d6 per sorcerer level. Proficiencies: daggers, darts, slings, quarterstaffs, light crossbows. Saving throws: Constitution, Charisma. Skills: choose two from Arcana, Deception, Insight, Intimidation, Persuasion and Religion.</p></description>
