	<element name="Elemental Affinity" type="Archetype Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_ARCHETYPE_FEATURE_DRACONIC_BLOODLINE_ELEMENTAL_AFFINITY">
		<description><p>When you cast a spell that deals damage of the type associated with your draconic ancestry, you can add your Charisma modifier to one damage roll of that spell, and spend 1 sorcery point to gain resistance to that damage type for 1 hour.</p></description>
	</element>

	<element name="Dragon Wings" type="Archetype Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_ARCHETYPE_FEATURE_DRACONIC_BLOODLINE_DRAGON_WINGS">
		<description><p>As a bonus action you can sprout a pair of dragon wings, gaining a flying speed equal to your current speed, until you dismiss them. You can’t do so while wearing armor not made to accommodate them.</p></description>
	</element>

	<element name="Draconic Presence" type="Archetype Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_ARCHETYPE_FEATURE_DRACONIC_BLOODLINE_DRACONIC_PRESENCE">
		<description><p>As an action, spend 5 sorcery points to exude an aura of awe or fear (your choice) to 60 feet for 1 minute. Hostile creatures starting their turn in the aura must succeed on a Wisdom save or be charmed (awe) or frightened (fear) until the aura ends.</p></description>
	</element>

	<element name="Draconic Bloodline" type="Archetype" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_WOTC_PHB_ARCHETYPE_DRACONIC_BLOODLINE">
		<supports>Sorcerous Origin, Sorcerer</supports>
		<description><p>Your innate magic comes from draconic magic that was mingled with your blood or that of your ancestors.</p></description>
		<sheet display="false" />
